{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y对人物心理动机和因果关系的解释有所压缩，X在说明他为什么犹豫、为什么改变决定时更充分，尤其是S08、S11。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用高亮短句迅速标出每段的心理转折，感受又随音乐实际出现，扫屏时更容易抓住重点，不必在一堆并列词语里自己拼凑。旧歌、舞步、摇篮曲等反复出现的线索，加上细致的力度、节奏、音色和情绪变化，让前后更像一段连续发展的经历，感受也明显更具体。它的代价是压缩了一部分人物心理的解释，X在交代事情为什么发生、人物为什么这样选择方面更有说服力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5e0887e0-03e0-4a46-b994-db11f226d301", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T002758090239Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T00:28:56.119093+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9317508749ac839cbb854f2a8544df7932a6450bcdc75a7775c3acb21831ebee", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attach